### references/canvas-schema.md  [docs]
- # Canvas Schema for bear-share-sync
- ## Node Layout
- Share-sourced nodes use these attributes:
- | Field | Value | Notes |
- |---|---|---|
- | `id` | `share-{bear_note_id}` | Prefixed to avoid collisions |
- | `type` | `text` | Always text nodes |
- | `color` | `"4"` | Green — distinguishes share-sourced nodes |
- | `width` | `260` | Fixed width for consistency |
- | `height` | `160` | Default; increase for long content |
- | `text` | `**{title}**\n{excerpt}` | Markdown with bold title |
- ## Positioning Algorithm
- - Grid layout: 40px gap between nodes
- - Row wrap at 1200px total width
- - New rows start below the tallest node in the previous row
- - Origin (0,0) at top-left
- ## Canvas File Format
- Standard JSON Canvas 1.0:
-   "nodes": [...],
-   "edges": [...]
- The skill only appends to `nodes` and does not modify existing nodes or edges.
+ # Canvas Schema Reference
+ ## agent_capabilities.canvas
+ Uses the [JSON Canvas 1.0 spec](https://jsoncanvas.org/spec/1.0/).
+ ### Structure
+   "nodes": [
+     {
+     {
+     {
+       "id": "group-shared-notes",
+       "type": "group",
+       "label": "Shared Notes",
+       "x": -100, "y": -100,
+       "width": 800, "height": 600,
+       "color": "5"
+     },
+       "id": "share-<note-id>",
+       "type": "text",
+       "text": "## Note Title\n\nContent excerpt…",
+       "x": 0, "y": 0,
+       "width": 400, "height": 200,
+       "color": "4"
+     }
+     }
+   ],
+   "edges": [
+       "id": "edge-share-<note-id>",
+       "fromNode": "group-shared-notes",
+       "fromSide": "bottom",
+       "toNode": "share-<note-id>",
+       "toSide": "top",
+       "toEnd": "arrow"
+   ]
+ ### Node ID Convention
+ - Group: `group-shared-notes`
+ - Note nodes: `share-<bear-note-id>`
+ - Edges: `edge-share-<bear-note-id>`
+ ### Color Codes
+ | Value | Color | Usage |
+ |-------|-------|-------|
+ | `"4"` | Green | Shared note nodes |
+ | `"5"` | Cyan | Group container |
+ ### Layout
+ - New nodes stack vertically with 250px spacing
+ - Group node auto-expands height to contain children
+ - X offset = 0, Y = max(existing Y) + 200

